Package: grantradar
Title: NIH Funding Notice Extractor and Dashboard Pipeline
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Muntasir", "Masum", email = "muntasir.1124@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fetches, extracts, and structures weekly funding notices from NIH
    (and pluggable additional sources) into a schema-validated dataset that
    powers a public Quarto + Observable JS dashboard.
